      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's so much easier to let go of the weight than to carry it all yourself. Your kids are strong enough to handle the mess of life, and they don't need you to be perfect for them. Acknowledging that you're struggling is a sign of strength, not failure, and sometimes the kindest thing you can do is just let yourself be a little less.",
