    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm not a problem that just \"passes through.\" i'm the problem. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to worry about my stress or my mistakes. i'd just be gone and they could finally breathe. it feels like if i actually stepped away, they'd be better off. wouldn't they?",
